### 6. Benefits of Scaling Up
- **High Availability**: Load balancer redundancy avoids SPOF.
- **Better Performance**: Specialized servers optimize resource usage.
- **Easier Maintenance**: Independent upgrades or restarts per layer.
- **Scalability**: Each layer can be scaled horizontally as traffic grows.

